# Lightweight Lineage

An offline tool for scanning repositories and generating data lineage.

## Development setup

Requires Python 3.12 or later.

```powershell
python -m venv .venv
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pip install -e .
```

## Current command

The current command parses T-SQL files and emits object-level lineage as JSON.
Interactive HTML rendering and GUI support are not implemented yet.

```powershell
lineage scan path\to\repository --output lineage.json
```

The command defaults to a five-minute whole-scan timeout. `--timeout` overrides
it in seconds. Repeated `--map ALIAS=TARGET` options supply explicit object
mappings. Repeated `--var NAME=VALUE` options supply Jinja2 template values.
Without `--output`, the lineage JSON is written to standard output.
